  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1.Implementering av UNFPA Business Plan om Maternal health Thematic   Fund - fond f&#xf6;r insatser att st&#xe4;rka barnmorskor globalt samt mildra   konsekvenser av fistula.Barnmorskef&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning sker bl a genom ICM,   Internationalla barnmorskefederationen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the UNFPA Business Plan of the Maternal Health      Thematic Fund - fund for reducing maternal mortality through          strengthening midwifery globally and campaign to end Fistula. The     midwifery strengthens via cooperation with the ICM, International     confideration of Midwifes.</narrative>
  </description>
